{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.util.Arrays;\nimport java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class C {\n    static final int INF = (int) 1e6;\n    static int[][][][] dp;\n    static String numStr;\n\n    public static int solve(int idx, int posCount, int negCount, int carryOffset) {\n        int trueCarry = carryOffset - 50;\n        if (idx == 17) {\n            return (posCount + negCount + trueCarry == 0) ? 0 : INF;\n        }\n        if (dp[idx][posCount][negCount][carryOffset] != -1) {\n            return dp[idx][posCount][negCount][carryOffset];\n        }\n        int best = INF;\n        for (int p = 0; p <= Math.min(15, posCount); p++) {\n            for (int q = 0; q <= Math.min(15, negCount); q++) {\n                int sum = posCount - negCount + trueCarry;\n                int digit = (sum % 10 + 10) % 10;\n                int nextCarry = sum > 0 ? sum / 10 : (sum - 9) / 10;\n                if (digit != numStr.charAt(idx) - '0') continue;\n                int cost = solve(idx + 1, posCount - p, negCount - q, nextCarry + 50) + (p + q) * (idx + 1);\n                if (cost < best) best = cost;\n            }\n        }\n        return dp[idx][posCount][negCount][carryOffset] = best;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long input = scanner.nextLong();\n        int bound = 50;\n        dp = new int[20][bound][bound][100];\n        for (int i = 0; i < 20; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < bound; j++) {\n                for (int k = 0; k < bound; k++) {\n                    Arrays.fill(dp[i][j][k], -1);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        numStr = Long.toString(input);\n        while (numStr.length() < 17) {\n            numStr = \"0\" + numStr;\n        }\n        numStr = new StringBuilder(numStr).reverse().toString();\n        int answer = INF;\n        for (int p = 0; p < bound; p++) {\n            for (int n = 0; n < bound; n++) {\n                int candidate = solve(0, p, n, 50);\n                if (candidate < answer) answer = candidate;\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(answer);\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <climits>\n#include <cstring>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nconst int INF = 1000000;\nvector<vector<vector<vector<int>>>> dp;\nstring numStr;\n\nint solve(int idx, int posCount, int negCount, int carryOffset) {\n    int trueCarry = carryOffset - 50;\n    if (idx == 17) {\n        return (posCount + negCount + trueCarry == 0) ? 0 : INF;\n    }\n    if (dp[idx][posCount][negCount][carryOffset] != -1) {\n        return dp[idx][posCount][negCount][carryOffset];\n    }\n    int best = INF;\n    int maxP = min(15, posCount);\n    int maxQ = min(15, negCount);\n    for (int p = 0; p <= maxP; p++) {\n        for (int q = 0; q <= maxQ; q++) {\n            int sum = posCount - negCount + trueCarry;\n            int digit = (sum % 10 + 10) % 10;\n            int nextCarry;\n            if (sum > 0) {\n                nextCarry = sum / 10;\n            } else {\n                nextCarry = (sum - 9) / 10;\n            }\n            if (digit != numStr[idx] - '0') continue;\n            int cost = solve(idx + 1, posCount - p, negCount - q, nextCarry + 50) + (p + q) * (idx + 1);\n            if (cost < best) best = cost;\n        }\n    }\n    return dp[idx][posCount][negCount][carryOffset] = best;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    long long input;\n    cin >> input;\n    int bound = 50;\n    dp = vector<vector<vector<vector<int>>>>(20, vector<vector<vector<int>>>(bound, vector<vector<int>>(bound, vector<int>(100, -1))));\n    numStr = to_string(input);\n    while (numStr.length() < 17) {\n        numStr = \"0\" + numStr;\n    }\n    reverse(numStr.begin(), numStr.end());\n    int answer = INF;\n    for (int p = 0; p < bound; p++) {\n        for (int n = 0; n < bound; n++) {\n            int candidate = solve(0, p, n, 50);\n            if (candidate < answer) answer = candidate;\n        }\n    }\n    cout << answer << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00010942813969450071, -2.50339189733495e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.00021073981770314276, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.00013481661153491586, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -1.07287787614041e-05, 0.0, -0.2555558979511261, -4.768370445162873e-07, -2.264974000354414e-06, 0.0, -0.18391455709934235, -7.152555099310121e-07, -6.794906312279636e-06, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.000750617531593889, -3.576278118089249e-07, -6.318072337307967e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.0011523280991241336, -0.0025295186787843704, -0.31326305866241455, -0.34846964478492737, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.05738744139671326, -0.1269335150718689, -0.0017610769718885422, -3.099436753473128e-06, -1.311301275563892e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.011076274327933788, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -1.2993727978027891e-05, 0.0